    "content": "All 19 checklist items have been tested and recorded. \n\n**Summary: 12 PASS, 7 FAIL**\n\nKey failures found:\n- **CS-8, CS-9, CS-11**: Dashboard editor accepts invalid budget ($0), negative guest count, and past dates — all replace the previously saved values instead of being rejected.\n- **IX-19**: Cancelling the wedding-details editor doesn't discard the draft; reopening shows the cancelled (unsaved) values rather than last saved values.\n- **FT-4 / CT-18**: Vendor keyword search has a relevance bug — it can return items (e.g. \"DJ Spark Entertainment\" for query \"photo\") whose visible fields don't contain the search term, so combined search+filter results can violate the \"every result matches\" expectation.\n- **IX-12**: \"View Details\"/\"View Profile\" buttons on venue/vendor cards do nothing — no modal or detail page opens, so users cannot see any information beyond the summary card.\n\nPassing areas: dashboard creation/editing (happy path), venue/vendor filtering, favorites add/remove, checklist browsing/opening/saving, task completion tracking with persistence, and content completeness of listings/checklists/dashboard."
